+/*
+ * The third argument of an SA_SIGINFO handler (arch/st20/kernel/signal.c): uc_mcontext is
+ * the interrupted user state (sc_state: Wptr, Iptr, Areg, Breg, Creg; sc_mask = first
+ * word of the old mask), uc_sigmask the full old mask.  rt_sigreturn restores both, so a
+ * handler may change them.
+ */
